ogging.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"warning"},{"anchor":"Custom-backends","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Custom backends"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Labels identify categories, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key=value"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit","title":"YubiKit","url":"\/documentation\/yubikit","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Connect and run commands on the different applications on a YubiKey. The framework support connecting using NFC, Lightning and USB.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","images":[{"identifier":"documentation-header.png","type":"icon"}]},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/GettingStarted":{"role":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","title":"Getting Started","url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/gettingstarted","kind":"article","abstr